pinion, if permitted to continue, affect a substantial part of the  \nmilitary aircraft engine industry, which industry isengaged in trade,  \ncommerce, transportation, transmission, or communication among the  \nseveral States or with foreign nations, or engaged in the production of  \ngoods for commerce, and which strike, if permitted to continue, will  \nimperil the national safety:\nNOW THEREFORE, by virtue of the authority ves","path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/texts/EO_11321.txt","sha256":"97951b1909bd8b82564d5678c56bbb7b0861761b6a9ea1154271e356bbe69f54","source":{"line":1202,"path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"cf99c8cb7501274ebe6eaf4ac8ee2b9d956ec103044b3a96d747141d6106b47b"}}]}
